Package: PFT
Title: Paper Folding Test (Vz-2-BRACE) for psychTestR
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Anton", email = "das.schreiberle@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Online implementation of the Paper Folding Test (Vz-2-BRACE), a
    measure of spatial visualisation. Both parts of the paper version are
    administered in one interleaved block with a six-minute time limit;
    skipped problems are presented again at the end. Based on the
    psychTestR library.
